<!doctype html><html lang="zh-Hant"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>DotAI Postframe · 拼圖工具</title><style>__EDITOR_CSS__</style></head><body>
<header><div class="brand-lockup"><img class="brand-logo" src="__BRAND_LOGO__" alt="DotAI" width="56" height="56"><div><p class="product-name">DOTAI POSTFRAME</p><h1>拼圖工具</h1><p class="header-note">Turn event photos into posts worth sharing.</p></div></div><div class="header-actions"><button id="export-top" class="primary" disabled>下載 JPG ↗</button></div></header>
<main>
<aside class="panel left"><p class="section-kicker">排版資料庫</p><label class="ratio-row">尺寸<select id="ratio"><option value="1:1">1:1 正方形</option><option value="4:5">4:5 IG 直向</option></select></label><h2>揀一個排版</h2><label class="filter-row">分類<select id="layout-filter"><option value="all">全部排版</option><option value="balanced">均分</option><option value="hero">主相突出</option><option value="strips">橫條 / 直條</option><option value="mixed">錯落</option><option value="slant">斜切</option></select></label><p id="layout-count" class="small-note">加入相片後顯示適用排版</p><div id="layouts" class="layouts"></div><details><summary>作品底色及留白</summary><div id="swatches" class="swatches" role="group" aria-label="作品底色"></div><label class="color-wrap">自訂底色<input id="bg-color" type="color" value="#FFFFFF" aria-label="自訂作品底色"></label><button id="save-color" class="secondary full">儲存目前底色</button><div id="saved-colors" class="swatches saved-colors" aria-label="已儲存底色"></div><label class="range-label">外框 <output id="margin-value">18 px</output></label><input id="margin" type="range" min="0" max="64" value="18"><label class="range-label">間距 <output id="gap-value">12 px</output></label><input id="gap" type="range" min="0" max="48" value="12"></details></aside>
<section class="stage"><div class="stage-top"><span id="layout-name">框內移圖 · 分界改比例</span><span id="size-label">1:1 · 1080 × 1080</span></div><div id="canvas-wrap" class="canvas-wrap"><canvas id="canvas" width="1080" height="1080" tabindex="0" aria-label="拖相片調構圖，滾輪縮放；拖白色圓點調整排版比例。按住 Shift 拖到另一格交換圖片。"></canvas><img id="initial-preview" class="initial-preview" src="__PREVIEW_DATA__" alt="拼圖預覽" hidden><canvas id="edit-overlay" width="1080" height="1080" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><div id="empty-state" class="empty-state"><h2>由你嘅相片開始</h2><p>加入 1–9 張相片，自動排版。</p><button id="empty-add" class="primary">＋ 加入相片</button><button id="show-demo" class="secondary">試玩示範圖</button></div></div><div id="canvas-tools" class="canvas-tools" hidden role="toolbar" aria-label="所選相片工具"><span id="selected-label"></span><div id="photo-actions"><button id="canvas-zoom-out" title="縮小相片" aria-label="縮小相片">−</button><button id="canvas-zoom-in" title="放大相片" aria-label="放大相片">＋</button><button id="swap-select" title="選取另一張相片交換" aria-pressed="false">交換</button><button id="canvas-center" title="相片置中及還原縮放" aria-label="相片置中及還原縮放">⊙</button></div><div id="frame-actions" hidden><button id="frame-reset" title="還原排版比例" aria-label="還原排版比例">↺</button><button id="make-hero" title="設為最大主相" aria-label="設為最大主相">▣</button></div><div id="slant-actions" hidden><button id="slant-straight" title="還原直線" aria-label="還原直線">還原直線</button></div><button id="swap-cancel" hidden>取消交換</button></div><p id="mode-hint" class="mode-hint" aria-live="polite">加入相片開始</p><p class="stage-caption">點相片：拖角點縮放、拖中間移焦點。點邊線：橙色圓點調相框比例。長按半秒再拖可交換相片。</p><div class="mode-switch" role="group" aria-label="編輯模式"><button id="photo-mode" aria-pressed="true"><span aria-hidden="true">▧</span> 相片</button><button id="frame-mode" aria-pressed="false"><span aria-hidden="true">▣</span> 相框</button><button id="slant-mode" aria-pressed="false" title="至少需要兩張相片">斜切</button></div><button id="help-toggle" title="操作說明及快捷鍵" aria-label="操作說明及快捷鍵" aria-controls="editor-help" aria-expanded="false">?</button><section id="editor-help" class="editor-help" hidden aria-label="操作說明"><h2>操作說明</h2><p><strong>相片</strong>：拖圖片移焦點，拖藍色角點縮放；亦可用放大、縮小、置中按鈕。</p><p><strong>相框</strong>：拖橙色圓點改比例；點邊線或畫布留白亦可進入。</p><p><strong>斜切</strong>：按斜切，再拖菱形端點改共用分界角度；按還原直線取消傾斜。</p><p><strong>交換</strong>：選相片、按交換、再點另一張；亦可長按半秒再拖，或按 Shift 拖圖片。</p><p><kbd>⌘Z / Ctrl Z</kbd> 復原；<kbd>⇧⌘Z / Ctrl Shift Z</kbd> 重做；<kbd>Esc</kbd> 取消目前操作或收起說明。</p><p>畫布有焦點時，可用方向鍵微調圖片位置，按 Shift 加大步幅。按 ? 可開關說明。</p><button id="help-close" class="secondary">收起說明</button></section><div class="toolbar"><button id="undo" class="secondary" disabled>↶ 復原</button><button id="redo" class="secondary" disabled>↷ 重做</button><button id="reset" class="secondary">清空重設</button></div><div id="status" class="toast" role="status"></div></section>
<aside class="panel right"><p class="section-kicker">相片與品牌</p><section id="photo-section"><h2>相片</h2><div id="photos" class="photo-list"></div><label class="replace-label upload-photo">＋ 上載／換入已選相片<input id="files" class="file-input" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"></label><details open><summary>相片構圖</summary><label class="range-label">縮放 <output id="zoom-value">100%</output></label><div class="zoom-actions"><button id="zoom-out" class="secondary" aria-label="縮小已選相片">− 縮小</button><button id="zoom-in" class="secondary" aria-label="放大已選相片">＋ 放大</button></div><input id="zoom" type="range" min="100" max="300" value="100"><button id="center" class="secondary full">相片置中</button></details></section><section id="brand-section"><details open><summary>作品標誌</summary><p class="small-note">上載後只在本機處理。PNG 透明背景效果最好。</p><label class="replace-label">＋ 上載正方形標誌<input id="logo-square" class="file-input" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"></label><img id="logo-square-preview" class="logo-preview square" alt="正方形標誌預覽" hidden><button id="logo-square-remove" class="secondary full" disabled>移除正方形標誌</button><label class="replace-label">＋ 上載全名標誌<input id="logo-wordmark" class="file-input" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"></label><img id="logo-wordmark-preview" class="logo-preview wordmark" alt="全名標誌預覽" hidden><button id="logo-wordmark-remove" class="secondary full" disabled>移除全名標誌</button><label class="range-label">品牌排版<select id="brand-placement"><option value="none">不放標誌</option><option value="corner">正方形：左上角</option><option value="top">全名：中上白條</option><option value="bottom">全名：中下白條</option></select></label><label class="range-label">標誌大小</label><input id="brand-size" type="range" min="6" max="40" value="24"><label class="range-label">邊距</label><input id="brand-padding" type="range" min="12" max="64" value="24"></details></section><button id="export-bottom" class="primary full" disabled>下載 JPG ↗</button><a id="download-fallback" hidden>再下載 JPG</a></aside>
<template id="batch-upload-ui"><div class="batch-upload"><label class="replace-label upload-photo">＋ 新增相片（保留現有相片）<input id="add-files" class="file-input" type="file" multiple accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"></label><p class="small-note"><span id="photo-count">目前 4 / 9 張</span> · 按縮圖旁「移除」可減相，支援復原。</p><details><summary>重新選取整組相片</summary><label class="replace-label upload-photo">重新選取 1–9 張<input id="batch-files" class="file-input" type="file" multiple accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"></label><p class="small-note">會替換整組，可復原；第一次使用可在這裏換走全部示範圖。</p></details><p class="small-note">點選相片調構圖；要換相，請用「上載／換入已選相片」。</p></div></template>
<template id="slant-ui"><section class="slant-panel"><h2>排版斜切</h2><button id="slant-toggle" class="secondary full" aria-pressed="false">啟用斜切</button><p class="small-note">先揀排版，再調兩個方向。分界同步移動，相片不會越框互相遮蓋。</p><label class="range-label" for="slant-x">直分界傾斜 <output id="slant-x-value">0</output></label><input id="slant-x" type="range" min="-12" max="12" value="0"><label class="range-label" for="slant-y">橫分界傾斜 <output id="slant-y-value">0</output></label><input id="slant-y" type="range" min="-12" max="12" value="0"><button id="slant-reset" class="secondary full">還原直線排版</button></section></template>
</main><nav class="mobile-nav" aria-label="手機工具"><button id="mobile-canvas" aria-pressed="true">畫布</button><button id="mobile-layout" aria-pressed="false">排版</button><button id="mobile-photo" aria-pressed="false">相片</button><button id="mobile-brand" aria-pressed="false">品牌</button></nav><script id="icon-data" type="application/json">__ICON_DATA__</script><script id="photo-data" type="application/json">__PHOTO_DATA__</script><script>__BRAND_JS__</script><script>__CORE_JS__</script><script>__PALETTE_JS__</script><script>__APP_JS__</script></body></html>
